Subject: [PATCH 07/14] feat(debt): bulk settlement posts single cash voucher
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Migration 0074: allow 'MIXED' on CASH_VOUCHERS.PAYMENT_METHOD so a bulk
  settle (thu/chi toàn bộ với nhiều phương thức) posts exactly ONE voucher
  (PT/PC) for the total; per-method breakdown stays on
  FINANCIAL_SETTLEMENT_ALLOCATIONS
- FirebirdFinancialVoucherPostingService.PostBulkInTransactionAsync:
  one voucher for the allocation total, method = single method or MIXED,
  idempotency via (SOURCE_ALLOCATION_TYPE='SETTLEMENT_BULK', settlement id);
  extracted shared InsertVoucherAsync used by both single and bulk paths
- FirebirdFinancialSettlementService.PostBulkSettlementInTransactionAsync:
  1 settlement + M allocation rows + 1 voucher + N application rows,
  all inside the caller's transaction (no nested commit); existing
  per-allocation PostInTransactionAsync behavior unchanged
- Core: PaymentMethods.Mixed, FinancialVoucherSourceAllocationTypes.SettlementBulk
