From 9332820131c92b5543e0864ebcb6efd14c9e76fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muse <muse@hatch.local>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:09:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/14] feat(debt): settle single ledger entry in one
 transaction

Add IDebtWorkbenchRepository.SettleSingleLedgerEntryAsync for the ledger
row Thu/Chi buttons: settles exactly one source (SALES_ORDER /
RECEIVABLE_DEBT / PAYABLE_DEBT) with 1 settlement + 1 cash voucher +
debt update in a single transaction, reusing the bulk settlement posting
and the existing receivable/payable apply helpers. Rows are locked and
re-checked (spec C pattern) before posting.
---
 src/Kazuko.Core/Finance/FinanceContracts.cs   |  21 ++
 .../FirebirdDebtWorkbenchRepository.cs        | 255 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 276 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/Kazuko.Core/Finance/FinanceContracts.cs b/src/Kazuko.Core/Finance/FinanceContracts.cs
index 9fab82e..c70dfce 100644
