From: Muse <muse@hatch.local>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:11:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/14] feat(debt): ledger row quick settle buttons via
 settlement dialog
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Each ledger (customer/supplier) history grid gets a Thao tác column:
Thu (green) when CanSettle + RECEIVE + remaining > 0, Chi (red) when
CanSettle + PAY + remaining > 0; other rows show no button. Clicking
opens the shared Finance CashVoucherDialog in input-only mode
(pre-filled with the source document code, remaining amount and an
editable amount for partial settlement), then calls the new
SettleSingleLedgerEntryAsync backend for exactly that source entry and
reloads list + ledger + KPI.
